                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>At their 25th meeting, September 16, the military governors agreed that a German
                    delegate should be authorized to take part in the conference of the Inland
                    Transport Committee of the International Labor Organization to be held in Geneva
                    on October 31. The governors also stipulated that this decision would not set a
                    precedent, and that future similar cases would be examined on their own
                    merits.</p>
            </div>
